d dependency predictor, but I defer rather than reject the few comparisons whose intervals still permit meaningful positive effects. The feature_052 line is downgraded: H47 global outcome_014 feature_052 is near null (+0.0066), H39 already failed validation for outcome_006, and H16's subgroup effect remains unreplicated, so H16 is deferred. The feature_042 screen is mixed: H54 is promising, H55 outcome_006 is weak, and H29 outcome_010 is opposite and below the clinical threshold, so only H54 receives validation while H55 is deferred and H29 is closed. feature_034 remains unconvincing: H58 is clinically negligible, H57 is near-null/opposite, and H25 remains a deferred borderline lead. No accepted finding changes yet. Validation will determine whether H54 becomes a separate dataset-specific association. All conclusions remain associational and dataset-specific, with no implication of causality, mechanism, or external generalizability."
